			x: 2.0d
			y: 20.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Drygmys produce drops from nearby entities without killing them. The usual clean setup is mobs in Containment Jars around a Drygmy Henge."
				""
				"Use this for rare drops that would otherwise demand a loud mob farm."
