		{
			dependencies: ["1B2B6AC133C8B030"]
			description: [
				"Ars Elemental adds focused spell identities. Pick one lesser focus first, then build toward prisms and stronger elemental tools."
				""
				"Fire, water, air, and earth all change what your spell book is good at. This is where the mod becomes a build, not just a toolkit."
