		{
			dependencies: ["4A5D5DFA8021A999"]
			description: [
				"Ars Technica also adds Create-flavored glyphs. Press, Polish, Fuse, Whirl, Superheat, and Obliterate let spells imitate workshop processing."
				""
				"Use these when a compact spell setup is better than a full belt line, or when a turret needs to process items in place."
