			description: [
				"Ars Creo adds the Starbuncle Wheel, a simple way to generate rotational force for Create."
				""
				"Place a gold block in front of the wheel to increase RPM. It is a good thematic starter for a magical workshop before the larger Source Motor setup takes over."
