		{
			dependencies: ["4257F0D6D8DA7619"]
			description: [
				"Ars Energistique connects Source to AE2. The Source Converter can power an ME network from Source, and ME Source Cells store Source inside the network."
				""
				"This branch matters once AE2 is online. Before that, ordinary Source Jars and relays are easier to reason about."
			]
